-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">14 September 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q7. How can I apply for UKPSC Veterinary Officers Recruitment 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong></strong>\n<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_30101\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-30101\" style=\"width: 2550px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-30101\" title=\"UKPSC Veterinary Officers Recruitment 2026 Apply Online\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/UKPSC-Veterinary-Officers-scaled.png\" alt=\"UKPSC Veterinary Officers\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1478\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/UKPSC-Veterinary-Officers-scaled.png 2560w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/UKPSC-Veterinary-Officers-300x173.png 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/UKPSC-Veterinary-Officers-1024x591.png 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/UKPSC-Veterinary-Officers-768x443.png 768w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/UKPSC-Veterinary-Officers-1536x887.png 1536w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/UKPSC-Veterinary-Officers-2048x1182.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\"><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-30101\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">UKPSC Veterinary Officers Online Form 2026<strong style=\"font-size: 17px\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">